# ==============================================================================
# MEDICORE HEALTHCARE PLATFORM - ROOT GITIGNORE
# Prevents leaking sensitive Firebase service accounts, JWT secrets, and build files
# ==============================================================================

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Production Build Outputs
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/build/

# Environment Variables & Secrets (CRITICAL SECURITY)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
!**/.env.example

# Firebase Service Account Credentials (NEVER COMMIT)
**/serviceAccountKey.json
**/*serviceAccount*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Operational Logs & Telemetry
**/logs/
**/*.log

# IDE & OS Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?